      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Flame Graph\n\nTo view flame graphs for performance analysis:\n\n1. **Producer**: http://localhost:6062/debug/pprof/\n2. **Consumer**: http://localhost:6061/debug/pprof/\n\n### Available Profiles:\n- **heap** - Memory allocation\n- **goroutine** - Goroutine stack traces\n- **profile** - CPU profiling\n- **allocs** - Memory allocations\n- **block** - Blocking operations\n- **mutex** - Mutex contention\n\n### How to Generate Flame Graph:\n\n```bash\n# CPU Flame Graph\ngo tool pprof -http=:8080 http://localhost:6062/debug/pprof/profile\n\n# Memory Flame Graph\ngo tool pprof -http=:8080 http://localhost:6062/debug/pprof/heap\n```\n\n### Web View:\nDirect access to pprof web interface:\n- Producer: http://localhost:6062/debug/pprof/\n- Consumer: http://localhost:6061/debug/pprof/",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "7.5.7",
      "title": "Flame Graph Instructions",
      "type": "text"
    },
