      "id": 16,
      "options": {
        "content": "# GOGC & GOMEMLIMIT Settings\n\n### Current Configuration:\n\n**Producer:**\n- GOMEMLIMIT: 128MiB\n- GOGC: Default (100)\n\n**Consumer:**\n- GOMEMLIMIT: 256MiB\n- GOGC: Default (100)\n\n### Performance Impact:\n\n**GOMEMLIMIT** controls soft memory limit:\n- Lower values = more frequent GC\n- Higher values = less frequent GC but higher memory usage\n\n**GOGC** controls GC trigger:\n- Default: 100 (GC when heap grows 100%)\n- Lower values = more aggressive GC\n- Higher values = less frequent GC\n\n### To Test Different Settings:\n\n```yaml\n# In docker-compose.yml\nservices:\n  producer:\n    environment:\n      - GOMEMLIMIT=64MiB  # More aggressive\n      - GOGC=50           # More frequent GC\n```\n\nMonitor the charts above to see the impact on:\n- GC duration\n- Memory usage patterns\n- CPU usage for GC operations",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "7.5.7",
      "title": "Memory Settings Guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
